   "source": [
    "# Rolling LDA: init period sweep & K sweep\n",
    "\n",
    "### Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "Input: `checkpoints/df_with_noun_tokens.pkl` (notebook 2), `checkpoints/chosen_vocab.pkl` (notebook 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "Output: `checkpoints/rlda_init_vocab.pkl`, `eda_outputs/rlda_init_sweep.csv`, `eda_outputs/rlda_k_sweep_coherence.csv`\n",
    "\n",
    "- **1. Setup:** load the preprocessed dataframe and the locked vocabulary from notebooks 2 and 3\n",
    "- **2. Init period sweep:** sweep candidate `INIT_DATE` values; choose the earliest date where C_v coherence stabilises\n",
    "- **3. Init period vocabulary:** slice documents up to `INIT_DATE`; derive an init vocabulary as the subset of the notebook-3 chosen vocabulary whose terms appear in at least `VOCAB_ABS` init-period documents\n",
    "- **4. K sweep:** run LDA at each candidate K over `N_SEEDS` random seeds on the init period; report mean C_v coherence ± std\n",
    "- **5. Save checkpoint:** write `rlda_init_vocab.pkl` with the init vocabulary, chosen K, sweep results, and chosen `INIT_DATE` for notebook 4 to load\n",
    "\n",
***REMOVED***
